## 🏗️ Architecture Delivered

### Backend (`/server`) — Express.js + MongoDB

```
server/
├── config/          ← DB, Cloudinary, Stripe, Socket.io
│   ├── db.js, cloudinary.js, stripe.js, socket.js
├── controllers/     ← Business logic (5 controllers)
│   ├── authController.js
│   ├── eventController.js
│   ├── bookingController.js
│   ├── paymentController.js
│   ├── dashboardController.js
│   └── notificationController.js
├── middleware/       ← Auth, error, upload, rate-limit
│   ├── auth.js, errorHandler.js, upload.js, rateLimiter.js
├── models/          ← Mongoose schemas (5 models)
│   ├── User.js, Event.js, TicketType.js, Booking.js, Notification.js
├── routes/          ← API routes (5 route files)
│   ├── authRoutes.js, eventRoutes.js, bookingRoutes.js
│   ├── paymentRoutes.js, dashboardRoutes.js
├── services/        ← Email, QR code
│   ├── emailService.js, qrService.js
├── utils/           ← AppError, asyncHandler, helpers
├── server.js        ← Entry point
├── .env             ← Environment config
└── package.json
```

**18 API endpoints** implemented across 5 route groups:
- `POST /api/auth/*` — Register, Login, Logout, Refresh, Forgot/Reset Password
- `GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/events/*` — Full CRUD with search, filter, pagination
- `POST /api/bookings/*` — Create (with MongoDB transactions), Cancel, QR
- `POST /api/payments/*` — Stripe PaymentIntent + Webhook handler
- `GET /api/dashboard/*` — Admin stats, Organizer stats, User management

### Frontend (`/client`) — React + Vite

```
client/src/
├── api/             ← Axios instance + all API modules
│   ├── axiosInstance.js, index.js
├── context/         ← Auth state management
│   └── AuthContext.jsx
├── components/
│   ├── layout/      ← Navbar, Footer, ProtectedRoute
│   ├── events/      ← EventCard
│   ├── booking/     ← (Ready for expansion)
│   ├── dashboard/   ← (Ready for expansion)
│   └── common/      ← (Ready for expansion)
├── pages/           ← Route-level components
│   ├── Home.jsx     ← Hero, Stats, Featured, How It Works, CTA
│   ├── Login.jsx    ← Split-screen with form
│   ├── Register.jsx ← Split-screen with role selector
│   └── Events.jsx   ← Search, filter, grid/list toggle
├── index.css        ← Complete design system (300+ lines)
├── App.jsx          ← Router + ToastContainer
└── main.jsx         ← Entry point
```

