## 🎯 Design System Tokens

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `--surface` | `#161121` | Page background |
| `--primary-container` | `#6c5ce7` | Buttons, accents |
| `--tertiary` | `#ffb3b0` | Coral highlights |
| `--on-surface` | `#e9def6` | Primary text |
| Font | Inter (300-900) | All typography |
| Radius | 8px → 24px | Rounded corners |
| Glass | blur(20-40px) | Navbar, cards |

---

## 🔐 Security Features Built-In

- ✅ bcrypt password hashing (12 rounds)
- ✅ JWT access (15min) + httpOnly refresh cookies (7d)
- ✅ Token rotation on every refresh
- ✅ Role-based middleware (`admin`, `organizer`, `attendee`)
- ✅ Rate limiting (API: 100/15min, Auth: 20/15min, Payments: 10/15min)
- ✅ HMAC-signed QR codes
- ✅ Helmet.js security headers
- ✅ CORS configured
- ✅ Multer file upload restrictions (5MB, images only)

