## 📦 Running the Project

```bash
# Frontend (Terminal 1)
cd client
npm run dev        # → http://localhost:5173

# Backend (Terminal 2)  
cd server
npm run dev        # → http://localhost:5000

# Requires MongoDB running locally on port 27017
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Update `server/.env` with your actual MongoDB URI, Stripe keys, and SMTP credentials before starting the backend.
